- [Building a Processor](/academy/Build/WorkWithData/BuildingAProcessor) — processor basics
- [Relational Database Processor](/academy/Build/WorkWithData/RelationalDbProcessor) — database-backed processors
- [Processor Migration Guide](/academy/Reference/Processors/ProcessorMigrationGuide) — migrating from the legacy strand-based API
